Author: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date:   Tue Aug 11 06:52:24 2026 +0000

    feat(kpi): receptionist Google-review screenshot uploads feeding the reviews KPI

    Receptionists upload a photo of each Google review they receive; it is
    credited to them and assigned to a month, viewable in a monthly gallery
    with the added-date. The month's upload count is ADDED to the admin-entered
    manual GoogleReviewCount to form the metric the review tiers reward against,
    so the manager's manual path is unchanged (zero uploads => identical result)
    and the manual value stays fully editable.

    - New ReviewUpload entity + DTOs, IReviewUploadService/ReviewUploadService
      (reuses IMediaStorage WebP pipeline + object storage; deterministic keys)
    - Reception-role-gated API: POST/GET/DELETE /api/review-uploads
    - KPI integration: EffectiveGoogleReviewCount = manual + upload count, used
      in dashboard, payables bonus calc, and category display (admin sees split)
    - Astro /admin/reception-reviews page: upload + monthly gallery + nav link

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>

